# Underworld Breach's escape cost is the card's mana cost plus exiling three other cards; a card with no mana cost has an
# unpayable escape cost, so it can't be cast that way (the rulings). Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R} casts Breach, and Lion's Eye
# Diamond discards Lotus Bloom (no mana cost), Lightning Bolt and two Mountains for {R}{R}{R}. With six cards in the
# graveyard and four red mana floating, Lotus Bloom can't escape, while Lightning Bolt escapes for {R}, exiling three others,
# and Bot2 takes 3 (17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Underworld Breach
Lion's Eye Diamond
Lotus Bloom
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Underworld Breach.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lion's Eye Diamond.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Lion's Eye Diamond.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Choose(Discard your hand)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 6
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}{R}
! Bot1.Graveyard.Lotus Bloom.Cast
Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Escape)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain; Mountain; Lion's Eye Diamond)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 17
Exile.Count = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lotus Bloom; Black Lotus
